 "frontmatter": {
  "title": "July 2025 - Local File Support",
  "description": "Initialize projects and add components from local JSON files.",
  "date": "2025-07-07T00:00:00.000Z"
 },
 "toc": [],
 "hast": "\n<p>The shadcn CLI now supports local files. Initialize projects and add components, themes, hooks, utils and more from local JSON files.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"# Initialize a project from a local file\nnpx shadcn init ./template.json\n\n# Add a component from a local file\nnpx shadcn add ./block.json\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#8B8B8B94;--shiki-light:#6E7781\"># Initialize a project from a local file</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> ./template.json</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#8B8B8B94;--shiki-light:#6E7781\"># Add a component from a local file</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> ./block.json</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>This feature enables powerful new workflows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Zero setup</strong> - No remote registries required</li>\n<li><strong>Faster development</strong> - Test registry items locally before publishing</li>\n<li><strong>Enhanced workflow for agents and MCP</strong> - Generate and run registry items locally</li>\n<li><strong>Private components</strong> - Keep proprietary components local and private.</li>\n</ul>"
}
